{"step_index":561,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T17:52:29Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough updated explaining why demo data appeared (missing API key fallback) and how real extraction now runs cleanly with explicit error reporting and clean base64 image parsing.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Real Document Extraction & Elimination of Demo Data Fallback\\n\\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been updated with the following improvements:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Why Did Demo Data Appear?\\n- Previously, if the **Gemini API Key** had not been saved in Settings or if the API encountered a network error, the app had a fallback that injected the 3 hardcoded test leads (*Joseph Adona, Maria Gonzalez, David Sterling*).\\n- **The Fix:**\\n  - Removed the automatic demo injection.\\n  - If no API key is saved, the app now shows an explicit alert: *\\\"Gemini API Key Missing. Please enter your free API Key in Settings to extract real lead sheets.\\\"*\\n  - Added robust base64 image encoding for web camera captures so photos are properly transmitted to Gemini Vision AI without corruption.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Deploying the Update to Your Phone:\\nIn your terminal, run:\\n```cmd\\nnpx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. How to Extract Real Lead Sheets:\\n1. Open the app on your phone.\\n2. Tap **Settings** (gear icon in the top right) $\\\\rightarrow$ paste your **Google Gemini API Key** $\\\\rightarrow$ tap **Save** (you will see the green confirmation banner).\\n3. Tap **Snap Sheet** $\\\\rightarrow$ take a picture of any physical ValuTeachers Report Card or Lead Sheet.\\n4. Gemini will extract the actual educator's name, school, cell, FRS years, checkboxes, and meeting availability from the real card!\\n\"","Description":"\"Walkthrough explaining real document extraction and API key setup\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough for document extraction fix\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md with extraction fix\""}}]}
