{"step_index":563,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T17:52:33Z","content":"### Why That Happened:\n\nWhen you snap a lead sheet, the app sends the photo to the **Gemini Vision AI** engine to extract the handwriting. \n\nPreviously, if your **Gemini API Key had not been entered in Settings yet** (or if the API encountered a network error), the code had a fallback that silently injected the 3 hardcoded test leads (*Joseph Adona, Maria Gonzalez, David Sterling*) instead of telling you the API key was missing.\n\n---\n\n### What I Fixed:\n\n1. **Eliminated Fake Demo Data Substitution:**\n   - The app will **never** silently inject fake contacts when you snap a photo.\n   - If the API key is not entered yet, it will clearly notify you: *\"Gemini API Key missing. Please go to Settings (gear icon) and enter your free Gemini API Key.\"*\n2. **Fixed Camera Base64 Image Ingestion:**\n   - Photos captured with your iPhone camera are now cleanly encoded into high-speed compressed base64 payloads and delivered directly to the Gemini 2.5 Flash model.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Push the Update to Your Live App (5 Seconds)\nIn your PC terminal, run:\n```cmd\nnpx surge ./dist valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh\n```\n*(Replace `valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh` with your Surge domain if different).*\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Add Your Free Gemini Key & Snap a Real Sheet\n1. Open the app on your iPhone.\n2. Tap **Settings** (gear icon in the top right) $\\rightarrow$ paste your **Google Gemini API Key** $\\rightarrow$ tap **Save** (you will see the green confirmation banner).\n3. Tap **Snap Sheet** $\\rightarrow$ snap a photo of any real ValuTeachers Report Card or data sheet.\n4. Gemini will extract the actual educator's name, school, cell, FRS years, checkboxes, and meeting availability from the real card!"}
